// Pull requests — PR list. The landing screen after auth (when Inbox
// is empty / user picked the Pulls sidebar entry). Two tabs (My PRs /
// Reviewing) with search + DateRangeChip co-located on the tabs bar,
// and a filter-chip row below for Repo / Author / Reviewer / CI /
// Label. Cursor-paginated via GraphQL `search`, with InfiniteFooter
// at the bottom of the list.
//
// Renamed from InboxScreen.tsx in Phase 2 — the legacy filename was
// confusing because Pyor's "Inbox" is actually the notifications feed
// (NotificationsScreen.tsx). Phase 2 also migrated the data path from
// REST `/search/issues` to GraphQL `search` (see lenses.ts) so the
// list can grow past 50 items without a page-flip.

