// LocalReviewsScreen — Local Reviews list + 4-step launcher wizard +
// review surface. Phase 1 of ADR 0012.
//
// Architecture (top-level state machine):
//   mode: 'list'    → the persistent Local Reviews list page. Toolbar
//                     with filter input + Refresh + "Create new local
//                     review" CTA. Filter chips strip (non-functional
//                     in Phase 1 — Phase 7 wires them). Rows render
//                     status badge, title, repo, head→base, ahead/
//                     behind (—), +/− (—), files, viewed (0/0), notes
//                     count, lastActivity (created N ago).
//   mode: 'wizard'  → in-place 4-step launcher (Repo → Worktree → Head
//                     → Base). Renders inside the same PyorWindow shell
//                     as a full surface (NOT a Dialog modal — matches
//                     the design's `ShadcnPrePRLauncherScreen`).
//   mode: 'surface' → the existing LocalReviewSurface, now keyed by a
//                     persisted LocalReview entry instead of an ad-hoc
//                     (repo, head, base) tuple.
//
// The web build (no Electron bridge) still renders `WebBuildEmpty`; the
// new flow lives behind `isElectron()`.
//
// Status enum: Phase 1 uses a placeholder rule — `in-progress` if any
// comments exist, otherwise `ready`. Comment store lands in Phase 3,
// so for now `commentCountFor` always returns 0 and every review reads
// as `ready`. Helper isolated so Phases 4/7 can grow it without
// rewriting the row.
//
// Persisted LocalReviews come from `useLocalReviewsList()` (TanStack
// over localStorage). Creates go through `useCreateLocalReview`,
// deletes through `useDeleteLocalReview` — both invalidate the list
// query so the UI stays in sync across windows via the storage event.

