// Changes-tab sub-toolbar.
//
// Built on shadcn primitives - Button, Input, Progress, Separator,
// Dialog. No inline theme tokens.
//
// Layout (left → right):
//   Commit selector (Dialog button - opens the commit picker)
//   │
//   Viewed progress (X / Y + Progress bar)
//   │
//   Search-in-diff (Input with ⌘/ hint while collapsed, expands inline)
//                                                                       ↑ filler
//   Bulk collapse controls (Collapse all / Expand all / Reset)
//   computing diffs… N / M           (only while contents fetch runs)
//   Diff mode (Inline / Split) - segmented Button group
//
// SubToolbar is purely a visual layer - every action threads up to
// the parent ChangesTab via callbacks. The commit picker shares the
// Commits tab's infinite query (prCommitsInfiniteOptions) for the list.

