// PR header — top metadata strip above the tab strip on every PR page.
//
// Shadcn-only per ADR 0011: no useT(), no inline static styles, no
// imports from ui/primitives.tsx. Inline styles are reserved for
// runtime-dynamic values (label colours from GitHub, which arrive as
// raw hex; that's the only case here).

