// scales them down to its row icon size cleanly.
//
// `pyor-eye-half` is a hand-rolled "barely open" glyph - Lucide
// doesn't ship one. It reuses the eye-closed lid arc and adds a
// tiny pupil dot peeking through, so the closed → partial → open
// progression reads as a coherent family.
