// Description tab (renamed from Conversation per ADR 0008).
//
// Renders the live PR's body as markdown + a chronological timeline
// merged from /issues/{n}/timeline and /pulls/{n}/reviews. Right rail
// holds metadata (reviewers, labels, requested-reviewers, linked
// issues, participants).
//
// v2: description is editable when the viewer is the PR author, and
// a top-level comment composer sits below the timeline.

