// PR detail - composes the PR header, tab strip, and active tab body
// inside the PyorWindow chrome. Per ADR 0008 the four tabs are:
// Description, Commits, Checks, Changes.
//
// Data flow:
//   - On mount: fetch the PR (getPullRequest) + its changed files
//     (getPullRequestFiles, auto-paginated) in parallel.
//   - 401 surfaces the auth-expired card (see `authExpired` below), whose
//     "Sign in again" button does the signOut + navigate (same pattern as
//     PullRequestsScreen / NotificationsScreen).
//   - PR + files flow down as props to PRHeader / ChangesTab etc.
//   - Loading skeleton while the parallel fetches resolve.

